  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women, Peace and Security Agenda: Making UNSCR 1325 Work for Women of Su (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at providing technical support and educational resources to advance the implementation and monitoring the effectiveness and efficiency of the Sudan National Action Plan on Women, Peace, and Security at different levels.</narrative>
  </description>
